	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Laboravimus iam aliquandiu, venerande pater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pro pio, fideli et docto ludimagistro, qualem et recipiendum suasisti (qualemque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te nobis, si posses, missurum pollicebaris;<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">In einem nicht erhaltenen Brief. -<persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> und <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> hatten ferner (nach der Rückberufung des <placeName ref="l2">Aarauer</placeName> Schulmeisters <persName ref="p8383">Christian Hospinian</persName> nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>; s. oben <ref target="file12323">Nr. 2276</ref>, 4-6) den jungen <persName ref="p17847">Christoph Piperinus</persName> für das <placeName ref="l2">Aarauer</placeName> Schulmeisteramt vorgeschlagen; s. oben <ref target="file12323">Nr. 2276</ref>, 3 1-37.</note> pro quo omnes boni merito tibi gratias <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>habent).</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed omnia incassum!</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Vicit enim illorum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint sind die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName>; s. oben <ref target="file12323">Nr. 2276</ref>, 23-25.</note> improbum studium inde<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>fessaque sedulitas id, quod semel decreverint, perficiendi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Recepit senatus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>noster illum<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p18370">Ulrich Trog</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file12323">Nr. 2276</ref>, Anm. 7.</note>, quem ministri ecclesię <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> promotum<pb type="edition" next="654"/> voluerunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Maxime hoc negotio perturbarer, nisi certo cognitum haberem id non sine numinis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>voluntate factum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Proinde non est, ut posthac de ludo nostro sis in hac parte <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>solicitus, ut vel quemquam mittas, vel in quoquam commendando labores.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Receptus est <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ille.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Expectamus iam eius adventum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Civis est <placeName ref="l2">Aaroviensis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Avum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Wohl <persName ref="p6845">Heinrich Trog</persName>, der in den Jahren 1536 und 1540 als "der drissigen" oder "der Rathen" nachgewiesen ist; s. Urkunden des Stadtarchivs <placeName ref="l2">Aarau</placeName>, hg. v. Georg Boner, Aarau 1942 -Aargauer Urkunden 9, S. 283, Nr. 775; S. 287f, Nr. 7841.</note> habet senatorem.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Caeterum qualis sit futurus, certo iudicare non possum; talem tamen <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>fore iudico atque esse a quibusdam audio, quales illorum<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Hier ist besonders die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Geistlichkeit gemeint.</note> sunt discipuli.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Non enim ovum ovo magis simile<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 5, 10 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/i 486, <ref target="file10445">Nr. 410</ref>).</note> quam hi omnes suis praeceptoribus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>omnia ad nominis sui gloriam ecclesięque incolumitatem vertat infringatque <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>omnium hostium veritatis consilia et conatus<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 33 (Vulg. 32), 10</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quae de <persName ref="p3590">landtgravio</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>scripsisti,<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Nicht erhalten. - Dabei handelte es sich sicherlich um die Nachricht vom Sieg <persName ref="p3590">Landgraf Philipps</persName> über Herzog <persName ref="p20318">Heinrich von Braunschweig</persName>; s. dazu oben <ref target="file12328">Nr. 2281</ref> und Anm. 4.</note> pergrata fuere; incertus enim rumor quaedam ad nos pertulerat, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>adeo tamen diversa,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12324">Nr. 2277</ref>, 1-3.</note> ut, utri parti credendum esset, in dubio maneret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Vale et me tibi commendatum habe ecclesiamque nostram.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l2">Aarovię</placeName>, 21. novembris 45.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat vos uxor mea<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="11"><persName ref="p5976">Agathe, geb. Näf</persName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Tuae hum<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>anitati deditissimus <persName ref="p1553">Christi<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>anus Hochholzer</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> Antitistiti.</note> fidelissimo, domino suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>tanquam patri plurimum colendo. <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrychen Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
